# Test Of The Maestro (Q231), played by a level 39 Dwarven Artisan who already holds nine of each
# antidote ingredient and Toma's broken teleport device (the kills below bring each ingredient to
# its count; Toma's teleport has a scenario of its own): Lockirin starts it and pays the level 39
# set's Dimensional Diamonds; Balanki sends the traveller to Croto for the paint of Kamuru, the
# Evil Eye Lord gives the necklace, Croto trades them for the soldiers' letter and Balanki
# recommends; Arin gives the paint of the teleport device, Toma swaps the repaired device for it
# and Arin recommends; Filaur gives the architecture of Kruma, Lorain turns it into the antidote's
# ingredients, the leech, wasp and spider complete them, Lorain makes the report and Filaur
# recommends, the last recommendation; Lockirin takes the three recommendations for the Mark of
# Maestro; then relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
